      "widgets_values": [
        "change the picture 1 to Photorealistic Images, make the subjects skin details more prominent and natural\n\nA loving young couple portrayed as real humans standing together in a sunlit meadow. The young man has realistic black hair with soft natural strands, smooth fair skin with visible pores, warm expressive eyes, wearing a modern black tactical jacket with metallic details that reflect sunlight. The young woman gently leans on his shoulder from behind, her long caramel-brown hair rendered with natural softness and loose braids, glowing under the daylight. Her skin tone is warm and smooth with a natural blush, wearing an elegant white-and-red fantasy-inspired outfit with realistic fabric texture and embroidery.\n\nTheir expressions are gentle and intimate, captured in soft cinematic lighting. The background shows a vibrant green field with blooming white flowers, bright blue sky, and soft clouds. A small fairy-like girl in pastel clothing appears in the distance with translucent wings catching the light. Everything is rendered in hyperrealistic detail, 8K sharpness, lifelike depth of field, natural color grading, photorealistic anatomy, and a warm romantic atmosphere."
      ]
